<title>JAPAN: Japan Dec oil product imports--MITI.</title>
<headline>Japan Dec oil product imports--MITI.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Ministry of International Trade and Industry on Tuesday issued the following data on oil product imports in December(barrel equivalents are also shown):</p>
<p>	 (In 1,000 kl)(1,000 bbl) mth/mth%  yr/yr %</p>
<p> Gasoline	98	616.4     + 14.0    +126.7</p>
<p> Naphtha    2,644     16,631     + 21.6    +  5.5</p>
<p> Kerosene     706	4,441     +231.5    + 91.8</p>
<p> Gas oil	107	  673     + 48.6    -  3.6</p>
<p> Fuel oil A   125	  786     + 23.8	 0.0</p>
<p> Fuel oil C   200	1,258     +124.7    - 27.5</p>
<p>(Note: LSWR imports are included in the Fuel oil C statistics)</p>
</text>
